			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync editor element submodules for build alignment and binary integrity\n\nUpdate all tracked editor element submodules (Cocoon, Mountain, Rest, Sky) to their latest revisions on the Current branch to address HTTP binary corruption, force UI panel initialization, and regenerate build artifacts.\n\n**Specific Changes:**\n- **Cocoon:** Regenerate ESBuild artifacts and `RouteManifest.ts` to reflect updated SCM handler mappings and ensure runtime consistency.\n- **Mountain:** Fix `forward_http_request` in `Scheme.rs` to parse HTTP responses using raw byte slices (`&[u8]`) instead of UTF-8 strings. This prevents corruption of binary assets (images, WASM) proxied through the build tool.\n- **Rest:** Update the bundled `bin/Rest` executable to align with the latest Rust/OXC bundler pipeline refactoring.\n- **Sky:** Force initialization of the `MarkersView` in `InstallDiagnostics.ts` by explicitly opening the Problems panel during startup. This ensures diagnostic markers are rendered immediately, preventing a mismatch between the status bar count and the empty panel view.\n\nThese changes ensure binary data integrity in HTTP forwarding, resolve frontend diagnostic display timing issues, and maintain synchronization between the extension host and native backend.",
